<p>I can give myself permission for use of my art here as well, right?</p>
<p>If the purpose of demanding Creative Commons licensing is to prevent copyright infringement, then there is nothing to worry about. I can prove the media is mine. I already own the channel and I have no desire to create another using Wikidot.</p>
<p>It would be helpful if you read the SCP I have already written.</p>
<p>The Tianzhong facility is a real place. I have access to it. I can use it as a set for making movies. I have no intention of releasing video material under the Creative Commons.</p>
<p>Perhaps I do not belong here, or maybe I just don't understand. Why wouldn't I be permitted to link to my own IP using my own web-hosting site so I can retain my copyrights for my video material?</p>

